* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary

# A source file is always reviewable. deckExtract.ts carried a literal NUL byte
# inside a regex (now escaped), which made git classify it as binary and hide its
# diff in review — a file nobody can read is a file nobody checks.
*.ts diff
*.tsx diff
